--
-- **Main Features:**
--
--    * Creates UDP Sockets
--    * Send messages to Discord
--    * Compatible with [FunkMan](https://github.com/funkyfranky/FunkMan)
--    * Compatible with [DCSServerBot](https://github.com/Special-K-s-Flightsim-Bots/DCSServerBot)
