--
-- ## Fuel
--
-- ## Ammo
--
-- ## Detected Units
--
-- ## Check In Zone
--
-- ## Passing Waypoint
--
--
-- # Tasking
--
-- The FLIGHTGROUP class significantly simplifies the monitoring of DCS tasks. Two types of tasks can be set
--
--     * **Scheduled Tasks**
--     * **Waypoint Tasks**
--
-- ## Scheduled Tasks
--
-- ## Waypoint Tasks
--
-- # Examples
--
-- Here are some examples to show how things are done.
--
-- ## 1. Spawn
--
--
--
